title: PyCon DE 2027 Tickets
---
body:


> Ticket sales open on 21 October 12:00 CEST. 1,400 seats for three days on site.

## Four editions

Every three-day pass belongs to an edition. The edition says when you joined the year.
Prices in EUR, incl. VAT.

| | Edition I: Early Bird | Edition II: Blind Bird | Edition III: Wise Bird | Edition IV: Late Bird |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Opens | 21 October  12:00 CEST | when Edition I is gone, 4 November at the latest | 10 February, speakers announced | 3 March, schedule published |
| Size | 150 tickets | until 10 February | until 3 March | until sold out |
| Standard | 690 | 790 | 890 | 990 |
| Individual | 450 | 500 | 550 | 625 |
| Student | 275 | 300 | 325 | 375 |
| Shirt | Edition I, limited | Edition II, limited | Edition III, limited | Edition IV, limited |

Once an edition closes, it never reopens.

## Who pays what

- **Standard:** your ticket is paid or reimbursed by an organisation.
- **Individual:** you pay out of your own pocket.
- **Student:** you hold a valid student ID.

## Every edition comes with its shirt

Each three-day pass includes the shirt of its edition. Four editions, four designs, revealed
on 15 December. Every edition is limited: the shirts are custom made in the exact number
sold, no reprints, no sales, no shirts at the door. Sizes are final on 31 March, no changes or
additions after that.

## Our promise

No ticket in this shop will ever be sold cheaper than the one before it. Prices step up on
published dates and quotas. There are no promo codes and no last-minute offers. The earlier
you buy, the more you trust us and the less you pay.

## Remote tickets and day passes

- **Remote:** all talks live and on demand. Standard 190, Individual 90, Student free until
  10 February. Standard 240, Individual 140, Student free from 11 February.
- **Day pass:** on sale from 3 March, once the schedule is out. Standard 550, Individual 300,
  Student 200. No shirt.

## Masterclasses

19 April, full-day, small groups. Masterclasses are announced ongoing as trainers sign up. 
590 until 10 February, 690 until 2 March, 790 from 3 March. 

## Good to know

- Free refund until 2 April, any ticket.
- Masterclasses: switch classes until 2 April (subject to availability)
- Edition I: up to five tickets per order.
- Got your talk accepted after buying a ticket? We refund it, and you keep your edition and shirt. Same for volunteers and organizers.
- Teams of five or more: contact sponsoring for the [Silver package](/sponsoring/).
- Questions: [contact form](/contact/).